ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260905/202609050138421404_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260905/202609050138421404_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【战报新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-05/match2075435date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">赛季首败！皇马0-1贝蒂斯 姆巴佩补时失点埃斯皮进球越位无效</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.65" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260905/zhanbao_image_2075435_1788556346_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.65" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.65" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260905/zhanbao_image_2075435_1788556346_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260905/zhanbao_image_2075435_1788556346_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>埃斯皮进球被吹越位无效，姆巴佩补时失点。最终皇马客场0-1不敌贝蒂斯，遭遇赛季首败。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-05/6a9b333e4b9aenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">西甲积分榜：皇马3连胜终结，吞赛季首败！明日巴萨客战瓦伦西亚</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-05/match2067672date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">伊萨克3分钟2球！利物浦2-0伊普斯维奇 加克波两助攻巴尔科拉首秀</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260905/zhanbao_image_2067672_1788554792_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260905/zhanbao_image_2067672_1788554792_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260905/zhanbao_image_2067672_1788554792_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>伊萨克梅开二度，加克波贡献两次助攻，利物浦2-0击败伊普斯维奇，终结两连平，取得新赛季英超首胜。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-05/6a9b32d28eff7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英超积分榜：利物浦先赛取胜暂升第5，今晚曼城热刺维拉等队出战</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-05/match2059500date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">3轮不胜！大巴黎1-2摩纳哥距榜首7分 马尔基尼奥斯破门难救主</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260905/zhanbao_image_2059500_1788555229_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260905/zhanbao_image_2059500_1788555229_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260905/zhanbao_image_2059500_1788555229_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>马尔基尼奥斯破门，巴黎圣日耳曼以1-2不敌摩纳哥，遭遇联赛3轮不胜。</p><p><strong>【其它新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-05/6a9b38dae1b26native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">新赛季首败！穆帅：没仔细看争议判罚无法评论，回更衣室也没看到</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.98" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260905/202609050532195786.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.98" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.98" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260905/202609050532195786_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260905/202609050532195786_720.jpg"> </div><p>皇马0-1不敌贝蒂斯，遭遇新赛季联赛首败。赛后，皇马主帅穆里尼奥出席了赛后发布会。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-05/6a9b3a3b97feanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">皇马TV喷判罚：换成巴萨点球就重罚了，埃斯皮的球可能也不会被吹</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260905/202609050538174239_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260905/202609050538174239_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260905/202609050538174239_720.jpg"> </div><p>皇马本轮0-1不敌贝蒂斯，遭遇联赛首败。马卡报赛后摘录了皇马TV的即时评论，其中又提到了巴萨。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-05/6a9b12ec4f400native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">同时宣6人！官方：巴黎与恩里克、内维斯、帕乔、法比安等人续约</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260905/202609050250544838_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260905/202609050250544838_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260905/202609050250544838_720.jpg"> </div><p>巴黎官方宣布，与主帅恩里克及五名球员：内维斯、法比安、帕乔、贝拉尔多、马尤卢等人完成续约。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-05/6a9af0c460b18native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：恩佐最后几天无训练意愿 切尔西不想再陷入内耗决定卖人</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.6" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260903/202609032203324059.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.6" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.6" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260903/202609032203324059.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260903/202609032203324059.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺更新视频，谈到了夏窗关闭前的转会情况，透露了恩佐转会的内幕。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-05/6a9af301489fanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：小蜘蛛坚定只去巴萨或留队，关窗前也没考虑阿森纳等队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/6a8c157cae3b8_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/6a8c157cae3b8_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260824/6a8c157cae3b8_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺更新视频，谈到了夏窗关闭前阿尔瓦雷斯的情况。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a9adecf114e6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">混太惨了…罗马诺列自由球员名单无阿里，30岁阿里本人评论：咳咳</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609042313303248.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609042313303248_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609042313303248_720.jpg"> </div><p>30岁的前热刺天才德勒·阿里近期在社媒与罗马诺的账号互动，刷了一波存在感。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a9ada0f6c476native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">此前身披26号！切尔西官方：新援门将大马丁将球衣号码更换为1号</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609042247479334.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609042247479334.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260904/202609042247479334.jpg"> </div><p>切尔西官方宣布，新援门将大马丁将球衣号码更换为1号，而他此前已经身披26号球衣为切尔西出战1场比赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-05/6a9aec27ef374native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英媒：38岁本泽马在寻找新东家，英超球队可能寻求免签他</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.35" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260817/6a82b59052f9b_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.35" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.35" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260817/6a82b59052f9b_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260817/6a82b59052f9b_720.jpg"> </div><p>38岁的自由球员本泽马正在寻找新东家，可能会吸引英超俱乐部的关注。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-04/6a9add8e65951native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">无奈！莫耶斯：埃弗顿引援不够多我很失望，我们一直在想着赚钱</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260904/202609042315076560.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260904/202609042315076560.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260904/202609042315076560.jpg"> </div><p>莫耶斯出席发布会，表达了对埃弗顿本次转会窗进展的失望情绪，同时他也承认出售球员是必要之举。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-05/6a9af3a0f325anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：尤文只愿为租齐尔克泽支付250万 埃弗顿最后时刻租借遭拒</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.39" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251230/6953d3c36cbaf.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.39" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.39" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251230/6953d3c36cbaf.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251230/6953d3c36cbaf.jpg"> </div><p>名记罗马诺在今日个人博客谈及有关夏窗尾声齐尔克泽转会的内幕消息。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-05/6a9b0575b0a2dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：切尔西因卡马拉告吹而愤怒无比 和摩纳哥的关系严重受损</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020608118890.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020608118890_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260902/202609020608118890_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺在今日个人博客透露了截止日的幕后故事，透露切尔西对于卡马拉转会告吹非常愤怒。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-05/6a9b3489ee6c4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">新赛季英超两连胜！赫尔城官方：续约主帅亚基罗维奇至2028年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260816/6a8182621f051_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260816/6a8182621f051_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260816/6a8182621f051_720.jpg"> </div><p><span>赫尔城官方宣布和主帅亚基罗维奇续约两年，俱乐部拥有再次续约1年的选择权。</span></p><script> 	$(function(){ 	    $(".video-bg").find('span').click(function(){/*视频播放*/             var _this = this;             var index = $(".video-bg span").index(this);             var MediaArr = document.getElementsByTagName("video");             $(this).parent().hide();             MediaArr[index].play();             MediaArr[index].controls = true;             $(".video-box").each(function(i, item) {                 if ($(this).find('span').get(0) !== _this) {                     $(this).find('.video-bg').show();                     MediaArr[i].pause();                     MediaArr[i].controls = false;                 }             })         });  	if(typeof(canLoadImage)=='function'){/*新版图片打开方式定义*/ 		if(!((typeof(getNetType)==='function' && getNetType()) || canLoadImage())){             $(".img_wrap").css('background-color', '#D9D9DA').find('.play_btn').css('text-indent','0');         } 		var platform = $('input[name="platform"]').val(); 		platform = platform=='ios'?'ios':'android'; 		var img_op = img_op_value = ''; 		function show_small_gif1(){ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				img_op = get_img_op_attr($(this),platform); 				img_op_value = get_op(img_op,platform); 				var lineHeight = $(this).find('.play_btn').height();  				if((img_op_value==1||img_op_value==2||img_op_value==3||img_op_value==4||img_op_value==7)&&$(this).attr("data-thumb")!=''){ 				    $(this).css('background-image',"url('"+$(this).attr("data-thumb")+"')"); 				    $(this).find('.play_btn').html('').css('font-size','3em').css('color','white').css('line-height', lineHeight + 'px').css('background', 'url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/common/img/ic_gif_big@3x.png) no-repeat center center').css('background-size','104px'); 				} 			}); 		}  		setTimeout(show_small_gif1(),100); 		/*load_type 1=wifi,2=4G&&loadimg,3=4G&&noloadimg*/ 		function load_img(this_obj,load_type,status) { 			img_op = get_img_op_attr(this_obj,platform); 			img_op_value = get_op(img_op,platform); 			/*var img = this_obj.children('img:first');*/ 			var img = this_obj.find('img:eq(0)'); 			if(load_type==1){ 				if(img_op_value==1 || img_op_value==7){ 					if(img.attr('t-rc')==img.attr('src')){ 						open_img(img_op_value,platform,img.attr('t-rc')); 					}else{ 						this_obj.find('.play_btn').hide(); 						img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')); 					} 				}else if(status==1){ 					open_img(img_op_value,platform,img.attr('t-rc')); 				} 			}else if(load_type==2&&this_obj.attr('type')=='IMG'){ 				this_obj.find('.play_btn').hide(); 				img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')); 			} 			if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){                 img.load(function(){                     window.webkit.messageHandlers.imageLoaded.postMessage('test');                 }); 			}else if(platform=='ios'&&typeof(imageLoaded)=='function'){ 				img.load(function(){ 				    /*加载完成*/                     imageLoaded(); 				}); 			} 		}; 		 		var ms = 1000; 		if(platform === 'android'){ 		    ms = 10; 		} 		setTimeout(function(){ 			if(typeof(getNetType)=='function' && getNetType()){/*wifi*/ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				load_img($(this),1,0) 				}); 			}else{ 				if(canLoadImage()){/*载入图片*/ 					$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 						load_img($(this),2,0) 					}); 			}else{ 				$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 					load_img($(this),3,0); 				}); 			} 			} 		}, ms);  		$(".img_wrap").click( 				function(){ 				    var jumpUrl = $(this).attr('jump-url');                     if(jumpUrl){                         return openLink(jumpUrl);                     } 					load_img($(this),1,1); 					event.stopPropagation(); 				} 			); 		$('a').click(function(e){ 			img_op = get_img_op_attr($(this),platform); 			img_op_value = parseInt(get_op(img_op,platform)); 			if(img_op_value>=0&&img_op_value<=7){ 				open_img(img_op_value,platform,$(this).attr('href')); 				if ( e && e.preventDefault ) 					e.preventDefault(); 				else 					window.event.returnValue = false;  				return false; 			}     	}); 	}else{/*旧版本*/ 		function show_small_gif(){ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				/*console.log($(this).css('background-image'));*/ 				$(this).find('.play_btn').css("text-indent","0"); 				if($(this).attr("data-ratio") && /gif/i.test($(this).attr("type")) ){                     var ratio = $(this).attr("data-ratio");                     $(this).css({width:"100%",height:0,"padding-top":100/ratio+"%"}).find(".play_btn").css({top:0,height:'100%'});                 } 				if($(this).attr("data-thumb")!=''){                     $(this).append('<img class="img-thumb" style="position: absolute;top: 0;left: 0;width: 100%;height: 100%;object-fit: cover;" src="'+ $(this).attr("data-thumb") +'" />'); 					$(this).find('.play_btn').html('').css('font-size','3em').css('color','white').css('background', 'url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/common/img/ic_gif_big@3x.png) no-repeat center center').css('background-size','104px'); 				} 			}); 		}; 		show_small_gif(); 		$(".img_wrap").click(function (event) { 		    var jumpUrl = $(this).attr('jump-url'); 			if(jumpUrl){ 				return openLink(jumpUrl); 			} 			if ($(this).attr('type') == 'IMG') {                 $(this).css("width", 'auto');                 $(this).css("height", 'auto');                 $(this).css("background", 'none');                 $(this).removeClass("img_wrap");                 $(this).find('.play_btn').hide();                 var img = $(this).find('img:eq(0)');                 img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc'));                 img.attr('data-src', img.attr('t-rc'));                 event.stopPropagation();             }else{                 $(this).find('.play_btn').hide();                 var img = $(this).find('img:eq(0)');                 img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')).on("load",function(){                     $(this).css({width:"auto",height:"auto","padding-top":0,background:"none"});                     $(this).find('.img-thumb').remove();                 }.bind(this));                 img.attr('data-src', img.attr('t-rc'));             } 		});  	    if(typeof(getNetType)=='function' && getNetType()){             /*$(".img_wrap").click();*/             setTimeout('$(".img_wrap").click()',200); 		}else{/*旧版非gif图片3G直接载入图片*/             $(".img_wrap").each(function(i){                 if($(this).attr('type')=='IMG'){                     var img = $(this).find('img:eq(0)');                     var ratio = $(this).attr("data-ratio");                     if(ratio){                         $(this).css({                             width:'100%',                             height:0,                            'padding-top':100/ratio+'%'                         }).find(".play_btn").css({                             top:0,                             height:'100%'                         });                         img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')).on("load",function(){                           $(this).css({'padding-top':'0'}).find(".play_btn").hide();                         }.bind(this));                     }else{                       $(this).css("width", 'auto');                       $(this).css("height", 'auto');                       $(this).css("background", 'none');                       $(this).removeClass("img_wrap");                       $(this).find('.play_btn').hide();                       img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc'));                    }                 }             }); 		} 	}  	function get_op(img_op,platform){ 		img_op_arr = img_op.split('|'); 		if(img_op_arr.length!=4)return 5; 		switch (platform){             case 'android' :                 value = img_op_arr[0].split('_');                 break;             case 'ios' :                 value = img_op_arr[1].split('_');                 break;             case 'wap' :                 value = img_op_arr[2].split('_');                 break;             case 'pc' :                 value = img_op_arr[3].split('_');                 break;             default :                 value = [5,''];         }         return value[0]; 	}  	function get_img_op_attr(img_ele,platform){ 		if(platform=='android'){ 			if(window.zhibo8OpenImage && window.zhibo8OpenImage.openInnerExplorerBrowser){ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op_new'); 			}else{ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op'); 			} 		}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 			if(window.webkit && window.webkit.messageHandlers && window.webkit.messageHandlers.openInnerExplorerBrowser){ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op_new'); 			}else{ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op'); 			} 		}else{ 			op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op'); 		} 		return op_value; 	} 	 	function openLink(aHref) {         if(!aHref) return;         var aNode = document.createElement('a');         aNode.href = aHref;         aNode.click();     }  	function open_img(img_op_value,platform,src){ /*		if(!(img_op_value==1||img_op_value==2||img_op_value==3||img_op_value==4)){ 			return false; 		}*/ 		/*if(src=''||src==undefine)return;*/ 		if(img_op_value==1){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openNativeImageBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openNativeImageBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openNativeImageBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==2){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openImageLinkWebBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openImageLinkWebBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openImageLinkWebBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==3){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openWebViewImageBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openWebViewImageBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openWebViewImageBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==4){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openSystemWebViewBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openSystemWebViewBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openSystemWebViewBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==7){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openInnerExplorerBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openInnerExplorerBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openSystemWebViewBrowser(src); 			} 		} 	} 	}) </script><style>.video-box{position:relative;}.video-bg{position: absolute;z-index: 8 !important;width: 100%;height: 100%;background-color: transparent;}.video-bg span{position: absolute;left: 50%;top:50%;margin-left: -2.94em;margin-top:  -2.94em;width: 5.88em;height: 5.88em;background: url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/m_images/inside/outs/ic_play@2x.png) center/46px no-repeat;}.video-bg span{position: absolute;width: 100px;height: 100px;left: 50%;top:50%;margin-left: -50px;margin-top:  -50px;}</style>
